        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n\n    graph TD\n        %% External Entities\n        User[\&quot;👤 Operator / Browser\&quot;]\n        OllamaSvc[\&quot;🧠 Ollama (:11434)\&quot;]\n        OpenClawSvc[\&quot;🦁 OpenClaw (:18789)\&quot;]\n        DockerSvc[\&quot;🐳 Docker / Watchtower\&quot;]\n        HostOS[\&quot;💻 Windows Host OS (CIM / WMI)\&quot;]\n        BrainFiles[\&quot;📁 Subagent Brain Transcripts (.jsonl)\&quot;]\n\n        %% Processes\n        P1[\&quot;1.0 Collect System &amp; Engine Metrics (telemetry-daemon.ps1)\&quot;]\n        P2[\&quot;2.0 Buffer &amp; Atomic Write Storage\&quot;]\n        P3[\&quot;3.0 Evaluate Graph Authorization (rebac-engine.js)\&quot;]\n        P4[\&quot;4.0 Serve REST API &amp; Static Assets (server.js)\&quot;]\n        P5[\&quot;5.0 Render Visuals &amp; Canvas Charts (dashboard.js)\&quot;]\n\n        %% Data Stores\n        D1[(\&quot;D1: telemetry.json\&quot;)]\n        D2[(\&quot;D2: history.json (720 pts max)\&quot;)]\n        D3[(\&quot;D3: In-Memory ReBAC Graph\&quot;)]\n\n        %% Flows to Collector (1.0)\n        OllamaSvc --&gt;|HTTP Handshake &amp; /api/tags| P1\n        OpenClawSvc --&gt;|TCP Connect Socket Probe| P1\n        DockerSvc --&gt;|CLI Status &amp; Image Metadata| P1\n        HostOS --&gt;|CPU Load % &amp; Memory Metrics| P1\n        BrainFiles --&gt;|Tool Calls &amp; Agent States| P1\n\n        %% Collector to Storage Process (2.0)\n        P1 --&gt;|Raw Metric Dictionary| P2\n        P2 --&gt;|Atomic Replace| D1\n        P2 --&gt;|Append Rolling Sample| D2\n\n        %% Server Process (4.0) &amp; Data Stores\n        D1 -.-&gt;|Read JSON Snapshot| P4\n        D2 -.-&gt;|Read History Series| P4\n        P4 &lt;--&gt;|Query Access Path| P3\n        P3 &lt;--&gt;|Lookup Nodes &amp; Edges| D3\n\n        %% User / Browser to Server\n        User --&gt;|HTTP GET /index.html, /dashboard.js| P4\n        P4 --&gt;|Static Files| User\n        User --&gt;|Polling GET /api/telemetry (3s)| P4\n        User --&gt;|Initial GET /api/history| P4\n        User --&gt;|On-Demand GET /api/ping| P4\n        P4 --&gt;|JSON Telemetry Payload| P5\n        P5 --&gt;|Render DOM &amp; Redraw Canvas| User\n  &quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="lcflkMN-hw_7E6BzP6R1-1">
